      "text": "Atlas Integrated Systems, Inc.'s work on the Camp Pendleton Data Center emphasizes\nenvironmental stewardship alongside economic efficiency. The data center is designed to\nminimize energy consumption and use renewable energy sources where possible,\ncontributing to the Department of Defense's goals for sustainability.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Atlas Integrated Systems, Inc.'s work on the Camp Pendleton Data Center emphasizes\nenvironmental stewardship alongside economic efficiency. The data center is designed to\nminimize energy consumption and use renewable energy sources where possible,\ncontributing to the Department of Defense's goals for sustainability.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
